{
  "camel_example": "",
  "cmd_full_name": "milvusknowledgebase add-documents",
  "cmd_name": "add-documents",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Registers files that have been uploaded to knowledge base storage as knowledge base documents and automatically triggers parsing (chunking and embedding). Two import types are supported:\n\n`LOCAL_UPLOAD`: Works with the `GetKnowledgeBasePreSignedUrl` direct upload flow. This operation only registers the file and does not verify whether the file has actually been uploaded. Therefore, you must complete the PUT upload before calling this operation.\n`OSS_IMPORT`: Imports files from an external OSS bucket. The operation creates an asynchronous import task and returns a `knowledge_import_task_id`. The system downloads and registers the files in the background.\n\nA maximum of 100 files can be imported in a single request",
  "description_zh": "把已上传到知识库存储的文件注册为知识库文档并自动触发解析（切片、embedding）。支持两类导入：\n\n`LOCAL_UPLOAD`：配合 `GetKnowledgeBasePreSignedUrl` 直传流程（本接口只注册，不再校验文件是否已真实上传，因此必须先完成 PUT 上传）；\n`OSS_IMPORT`：从外部 OSS 导入，接口先创建异步导入任务，返回 `knowledge_import_task_id`，由系统后台执行下载与注册。\n\n单次最多 100 个文件",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun milvusknowledgebase add-documents --knowledge-base-id kb-3bd02617e9be335f --import-type LOCAL_UPLOAD --strategy-id kb-strategy-7043984ca395eabd --documents Path=2026_06_23_17_49_52WwGSUezpG2u2iHWxyYGzkf9KtormhkxN/CHANGELOG.md Size=1024 Name=CHANGELOG.md --dedup DocNameDedup=true ContentDedup=true --meta-fields department_:_legal_,_topics_:_policy_,_contract_,_reviewed_:true --ding-talk-configuration knowledgeId=ignore appPassword=ignore dingDocMcpLink=ignore dingTableMcpLink=ignore appId=ignore knowledgeType=ignore userId=ignore --dataset-id kd-03ec1e2385fcf --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "POST",
  "multi_version": false,
